# Artifact Engine

A lightweight artifact storage and retrieval system with GitHub integration.

## Features

- **Artifact Management**: Store, retrieve, update, and delete artifacts with metadata
- **Content Versioning**: Automatic version tracking for artifact updates
- **Search & Filter**: Find artifacts by tags, type, or content
- **GitHub Integration**: Sync artifacts directly to GitHub repositories
- **RESTful API**: Clean, well-documented API endpoints

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set up environment variables
cp .env.example .env

# Start development server
npm run dev

# Run tests
npm test
```

## Documentation

- [Getting Started](docs/getting-started.md)
- [API Reference](docs/api-reference.md)
- [Architecture](docs/architecture.md)
- [GitHub Integration](docs/github-integration.md)

## API Overview

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| GET | /health | Health check |
| GET | /artifacts | List all artifacts |
| POST | /artifacts | Create new artifact |
| GET | /artifacts/:id | Get artifact by ID |
| PUT | /artifacts/:id | Update artifact |
| DELETE | /artifacts/:id | Delete artifact |
| GET | /artifacts/search | Search artifacts |
| POST | /artifacts/:id/github | Sync to GitHub |

## License

MIT
